Previously, merchants had fragmented data from multiple sources like payments, customers, and settlements,
making it difficult to understand trends, identify high-value customers, or detect operational inefficiencies.

Our solution provided a centralized analytics dashboard that aggregated and processed large volumes of transaction and behavioral data in near real time.
It enabled merchants to view sales trends, customer segmentation, payment success rates, and industry comparisons — all through an intuitive interface.
From an impact perspective:
	•	It empowered thousands of merchants to make data-driven decisions, improving customer retention and revenue visibility.
	•	The system’s performance optimizations and modular redesign improved scalability and reduced operating costs by 40%.

